## Referensi Cepat: MUI → Tailwind

| MUI Component | Pengganti |
|---|---|
| `<Button variant="contained">` | `<Button variant="primary">` (komponen custom) |
| `<TextField label="Email">` | `<Input label="Email" />` (komponen custom) |
| `<CircularProgress>` | `<span className="animate-spin ...">` |
| `<Skeleton>` | `<Skeleton className="h-8 w-full">` |
| `<Alert severity="error">` | `toast.error('pesan')` |
| `<Snackbar>` | `toast.success('pesan')` |
| `<Dialog>` | `@headlessui/react Dialog` |
| `<Chip label="hadir">` | `<Badge status="hadir">` |
| `<DataGrid>` | `@tanstack/react-table` |
| `<Box sx={{ p: 2 }}>` | `<div className="p-2">` |
| `<Typography variant="h6">` | `<h2 className="text-lg font-semibold">` |
| `<Paper elevation={2}>` | `<div className="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border">` |